{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣に永島せいらりんがひたすら\n『まーやーー！』\nって、インコみたいにずーっと、呼んでくる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも投げキスからのゲッツしてくる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして目の前には斎藤のちはるさんがずっーっと真顔でみてくる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！ついに壊れた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかもう説明できない......！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでちはるさんは顔から下の半分が以上に動く"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で\n『筋肉が発達しちょん！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってせいたん風にいってた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついさっき、せいたんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーループースイチマンジャーク！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってやつで遊んでたっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでそんで渋谷でひなちまとお買いものする予定で２時に渋谷駅だったの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３０分前に着いちゃったの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからひなちま待ってると２時半になって、\n時間内に来る人だから心配で電話したら出なくて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"mailもかえってこなくて......！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはヤバイ！なんかあったんだ！って思ったの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら斎藤ちはるんが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあや！明日だからね！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってきてー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまとまあやが遊ぶの知ってて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでいつも私、曜日間違えるから、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたまちはるんが連絡くれたのー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命の恩人ガールちはるん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで私はひなちまが来ない理由がわかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまもね！\n前もって、何日の何時からだから！\nって、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も送ってきたのー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのに私は......今度から気を付けよう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ！？結局私はなんの話がしたかったんだろー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つたわったのかなぁー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁこんな感じです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←どんな感じだよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！しつもん返し！\n次回まで待ってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後、学校の行事でお泊まりにいくので、blog更新おくれます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待っててねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近間違えたことありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しい質問ですね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/16/7230436/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}